Rips_ClaimPayout_Referrer
├── given referrer is zero address
│   └── it should send the full protocol fee to the fee recipient.
├── given no referral tiers are configured and base fee is zero
│   └── it should send the full protocol fee to the fee recipient.
├── given referrer has a custom fee set
│   ├── it should send the referrer fee to the referrer.
│   ├── it should send the remaining protocol fee to the fee recipient.
│   └── it should emit a {ReferralFeeAccrued} event.
└── given base fee is set and referrer has no prior activity
    ├── it should send the referrer fee to the referrer.
    ├── it should send the remaining protocol fee to the fee recipient.
    └── it should emit a {ReferralFeeAccrued} event.
